    "body": "Quick pass (M5): the lock is derived (`interact::op_pick_locked`: an op is open, a non-Geometry tab, nothing armed), with no new state or command. A locked click is swallowed before the model/face routing (status says so; the dialog stays open, nothing is queued); hover and box drag are off while locked; the on/off line sits under the tab bar. Four pins with mutations red. Disclosed: the issue says \"toggles\", but a plain face click replaces and Ctrl+click on a picked face says \"already selected\", so the pin proves replace + undo; box drag is not pinned. The quick gate, ui 714 and clippy are green. #1514 is P3. Flagged ready; a review by the other session is next.",
